	)
	(text "LRA-06 CAPTURE - NOT FROZEN, NOT ACCEPTED, NOT FOR FABRICATION.\nPlaceholders D4 (five instances), J3, MAX_ON and VEHICLE_PROTECTION carry no\nselected part. Open questions Q1-Q7 are in validation/../CAPTURE_NOTES.md."
